<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-BARTOLI WINS LIEGE-BASTOGNE-LIEGE RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-BARTOLI WINS LIEGE-BASTOGNE-LIEGE RACE.</headline>
<dateline>ANS, Belgium 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Michele Bartoli won the 262-km Liege-Bastogne-Liege World Cup race on Sunday.</p>
</text>
